.TH hostid 1 (date) "GNU coreutils (unreleased)"
.SH NAME
hostid \- print the numeric identifier for the current host
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY hostid
.RI [ OPTION ]
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.\" Add any additional description here
.PP
Print the numeric identifier (in hexadecimal) for the current host.
.TP
.UR https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/hostid#hostid\-\-help
\fB\-\-help\fP
.UE
display this help and exit
.TP
.UR https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/hostid#hostid\-\-version
\fB\-\-version\fP
.UE
output version information and exit
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Jim Meyering.
